  "entry": "code/web_app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A local web workbench where a researcher points at a server-side folder of ABF, electrochemistry CSV or TIFF recordings, detects peaks, paired events or ROI intensities, exports CSV/PNG/SVG/GIF, and gets an automatic run manifest for each export so it can be reproduced. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
